      "node_id": "kg_doc_16",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Victim of Romance is singer and songwriter Michelle Phillips' first and only solo album, and was released in February 1977 (see 1977 in music). The record was unsuccessful and Phillips (previously with The Mamas & the Papas) then favored her acting career. The front cover photography was by Terry O'Neill.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999919627042,
      "temperature": 0.9999999919627042,
